# SPA fallback — every unknown path serves index.html so client-side routing
# works on a hard refresh or a shared deep link. Firebase Hosting did this with
# the "rewrites" block in firebase.json; Cloudflare needs it here.
#
# /assets/* is deliberately excluded above by being a real file: a missing
# chunk must return 404, not index.html. Serving HTML in place of JavaScript
# turns a clear "file not found" into a baffling syntax error.
/*    /index.html   200
